WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.268 --> 00:00:02.685
(rock music)

00:00:04.147 --> 00:00:05.857
- [Host] When Mad Max meets Burning Man

00:00:05.857 --> 00:00:08.024
you get Wasteland Weekend.

00:00:11.643 --> 00:00:13.402
Wasteland Weekend takes place

00:00:13.402 --> 00:00:16.589
in the middle of
California's Mojave Desert

00:00:16.589 --> 00:00:21.135
and is the world's largest
post-apocalyptic festival.

00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:23.620
Founded in 2010, this four day event

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.742
sees nearly 3,000 desolation enthusiasts.

00:00:27.742 --> 00:00:29.081
Attendees are required to dress

00:00:29.081 --> 00:00:31.837
in the post-apocalyptic style dress code

00:00:31.837 --> 00:00:34.670
and the costumes don't disappoint.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:41.014
Festival organizers design
and build elaborate set pieces

00:00:41.014 --> 00:00:42.761
but it's the gear heads who attend

00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:46.928
that bring the world of
crumbling civilization to life.

00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:51.265
So as long as you're willing to commit

00:00:51.265 --> 00:00:53.282
to the spirit of the end of the world,

00:00:53.282 --> 00:00:55.738
you'll be welcomed with open arms.

00:00:55.738 --> 00:00:58.155
(rock music)

